WEBVTT

01:35.880 --> 01:38.200
[Too Young To Love]

01:38.470 --> 01:41.270
[Episode 6]

01:42.950 --> 01:44.840
Open your books to page 248.

01:46.000 --> 01:47.460
Let's look at question 17.

01:48.000 --> 01:49.000
15 points.

01:49.640 --> 01:50.500
It's a freebie.

01:54.280 --> 01:55.280
Just memorize it.

01:56.479 --> 01:57.229
Mr. Bu.

01:58.120 --> 01:59.720
Mr. Bu, I have a question too.

02:00.070 --> 02:01.400
Figure it out yourself.

02:01.870 --> 02:04.710
Sorry. The subscriber you dialed
is powered off.

02:04.870 --> 02:08.150
Sorry. The subscriber you dialed
is powered off.

02:12.400 --> 02:13.590
Don't worry about Tong.

02:12.490 --> 02:13.300
[Have you reached Xiaole?]

02:13.300 --> 02:17.270
[Reborn! We Got This]

02:13.590 --> 02:15.590
He promised emphatically

02:15.810 --> 02:18.120
he'd definitely show up
for tonight's band performance.

02:18.120 --> 02:19.520
If we do well this time,

02:19.520 --> 02:23.250
we might be able to perform there
regularly for the next few months.

02:27.750 --> 02:30.240
You really think you can become a star?

02:28.710 --> 02:29.829
[You really think you can become a star?]

02:29.850 --> 02:31.190
[Look at you. You're nowhere near
as good-looking as my idol.]

02:30.520 --> 02:31.680
Look at you.

02:32.030 --> 02:34.690
You're nowhere near as good-looking
as my idol.

02:35.000 --> 02:36.630
We're an independent band.

02:36.630 --> 02:40.120
We're nothing like your idol,
who's just famous for his face.

02:43.680 --> 02:44.520
How about this?

02:44.520 --> 02:45.470
Well,

02:45.520 --> 02:48.240
I'll go to the office
and photocopy the study materials for you.

02:48.240 --> 02:48.910
Okay?

02:49.190 --> 02:50.870
Then you guys behave yourselves.

02:50.870 --> 02:51.870
Don't run around.

02:52.079 --> 02:52.750
Be good.

02:53.079 --> 02:54.410
Wait for me to come back.

03:09.680 --> 03:10.150
Come in.

03:11.560 --> 03:12.120
Mr. Bu.

03:13.680 --> 03:15.680
My stomach hurts a bit.

03:15.870 --> 03:18.530
Can I skip the next self-study class
and go home?

03:20.030 --> 03:22.690
Is it because you're worried
about Tong Xiaole?

03:23.870 --> 03:25.430
That's part of it,

03:25.750 --> 03:28.079
but my stomach really does hurt.

03:33.680 --> 03:34.870
I don't have any medicine

03:34.870 --> 03:35.800
for a stomachache.

03:35.800 --> 03:36.680
However,

03:36.910 --> 03:39.800
I specially prepared some study materials
just for you.

03:39.800 --> 03:40.630
Specially?

03:40.630 --> 03:41.240
Yes.

03:41.590 --> 03:42.430
For me?

03:42.430 --> 03:43.190
Yes.

03:45.520 --> 03:48.470
Because you're my most promising student.

03:49.079 --> 03:50.079
Most promising?

03:50.190 --> 03:51.750
So just go back

03:51.870 --> 03:53.310
for the next self-study class.

03:53.310 --> 03:54.360
As for Tong Xiaole,

03:54.360 --> 03:55.520
I'll contact him.

03:56.310 --> 03:57.079
Okay.

03:57.079 --> 03:57.520
Go back now.

03:57.520 --> 03:58.360
Okay.

04:01.800 --> 04:03.910
Mr. Bu, I won't let you down.

04:04.080 --> 04:04.470
Good.

04:14.430 --> 04:15.150
Chen Fan.

04:15.470 --> 04:16.240
What's wrong?

04:16.240 --> 04:18.750
Mr. Bu, my throat...

04:20.310 --> 04:23.240
Is it also because you're worried
about Tong Xiaole?

04:26.070 --> 04:26.480
Here.

04:28.190 --> 04:29.870
I really don't have any medicine

04:29.870 --> 04:30.870
for a sore throat.

04:30.870 --> 04:31.680
However,

04:32.190 --> 04:34.430
I specially prepared some study materials
just for you.

04:34.430 --> 04:35.190
Specially?

04:35.310 --> 04:35.800
Yes.

04:36.430 --> 04:38.560
Because you're my most promising student.

04:38.560 --> 04:39.490
Most promising?

04:39.560 --> 04:39.920
Yes.

04:40.190 --> 04:42.590
Just go back
for the next self-study class.

04:42.800 --> 04:43.560
Thank you, Mr. Bu.

04:43.560 --> 04:44.750
I'll definitely study hard.

04:44.750 --> 04:45.190
Good.

05:34.240 --> 05:36.100
Why haven't you come to class yet?

05:37.000 --> 05:38.159
It's already noon.

05:39.190 --> 05:39.990
Where are you?

05:41.270 --> 05:42.390
Are you okay?

05:43.450 --> 05:46.900
[Reply soon]

05:44.000 --> 05:44.950
Reply soon.

05:54.870 --> 05:55.310
Hello.

05:56.430 --> 05:58.240
Xiaole, you finally answered!

05:58.310 --> 06:01.570
We were all worried sick
because you didn't come to school.

06:03.000 --> 06:03.630
I'm fine.

06:04.120 --> 06:05.310
I just overslept.

06:06.360 --> 06:08.120
Don't forget the band performance
at 7 PM tonight.

06:08.120 --> 06:10.240
I'll wait for you at the venue
after class.

06:10.240 --> 06:10.750
Okay.

06:11.800 --> 06:12.680
I got it.

06:12.680 --> 06:13.480
It's still early.

06:13.480 --> 06:15.080
Don't worry. I won't be late.

06:16.190 --> 06:17.630
Dad, why are you back?

06:18.240 --> 06:19.120
Why are you at home?

06:19.120 --> 06:20.450
You didn't go to school?

06:21.680 --> 06:23.430
Dad, I have something urgent.

06:23.430 --> 06:24.360
I'm heading out.

06:24.430 --> 06:25.120
What kind of urgent matter
is more important

06:25.120 --> 06:26.310
than going to school?

06:26.310 --> 06:28.310
Do you realize you are skipping class?

06:28.310 --> 06:29.120
Get inside!

06:37.120 --> 06:38.680
What kind of attitude is that?

06:38.680 --> 06:39.810
Apologize to Mr. Bu.

06:42.800 --> 06:44.240
I'm sorry, Mr. Bu.

06:44.310 --> 06:45.120
I overslept.

06:46.240 --> 06:47.750
You overslept?

06:47.750 --> 06:49.120
You made so many people worry about you!

06:49.120 --> 06:51.120
And I even rushed back from out of town.

06:51.120 --> 06:53.120
How can you be so thoughtless?

06:53.310 --> 06:54.120
Mr. Tong.

06:54.190 --> 06:54.680
Well,

06:55.430 --> 06:56.800
as long as Xiaole is fine,
that's all that matters.

06:56.800 --> 06:58.240
Kids at this age

06:58.240 --> 06:59.430
are quite rebellious.

06:59.430 --> 07:00.360
Just talk to him calmly.

07:00.360 --> 07:00.890
Alright.

07:01.000 --> 07:01.560
I'm leaving first.

07:01.560 --> 07:02.120
Okay.

07:03.560 --> 07:04.240
It's fine.

07:05.120 --> 07:05.800
Take care.

07:12.240 --> 07:15.400
[Pre-filled College Application
Preference Form]

07:12.430 --> 07:13.800
Explain yourself.

07:14.000 --> 07:15.560
Why didn't you fill it in?

07:18.920 --> 07:20.750
Didn't I tell you to choose Finance?

07:20.750 --> 07:22.120
If I hadn't come back this time,

07:22.120 --> 07:24.070
I wouldn't have known
you did something so ridiculous!

07:24.070 --> 07:24.630
You were not even at home.

07:24.630 --> 07:25.310
Who was I supposed to ask?

07:25.310 --> 07:26.360
Couldn't you have called?

07:26.360 --> 07:28.240
Like you ever answer your phone?

07:29.120 --> 07:29.920
Fine.

07:31.120 --> 07:32.120
You don't want to choose Finance.

07:32.120 --> 07:34.450
Then tell me
what major you want to choose.

07:37.870 --> 07:38.310
Okay.

07:39.000 --> 07:40.560
Since you don't have a major
of your choice,

07:40.560 --> 07:41.960
you must choose Finance.

07:43.240 --> 07:44.750
Why should I listen to you?

07:44.800 --> 07:46.240
Because I'm your father!

07:46.240 --> 07:47.920
You must do what I say!

07:49.920 --> 07:51.250
Choose Finance, right?

07:51.680 --> 07:53.000
You want me to choose Finance.

07:53.000 --> 07:54.240
Isn't it just because you want me
to become like you,

07:54.240 --> 07:56.190
spending every single day chasing money?

07:56.190 --> 07:58.120
Is that how you talk to your father?

08:02.800 --> 08:04.000
You ungrateful brat!

08:14.430 --> 08:15.360
Xiaole.

08:17.310 --> 08:18.480
Are you okay?

08:18.870 --> 08:20.730
I've been looking for you all day.

08:32.320 --> 08:32.909
Sir,

08:32.909 --> 08:33.870
I'm begging you.

08:33.870 --> 08:34.789
My partner isn't here yet.

08:34.789 --> 08:36.240
This performance is very important to me.

08:36.240 --> 08:37.320
It's important to everyone!

08:37.320 --> 08:38.669
Can't you see everyone's already waiting?

08:38.669 --> 08:39.789
Just give me a little more time, please.

08:39.789 --> 08:41.630
No! Let go!

08:41.630 --> 08:42.690
He'll be here soon.

08:42.750 --> 08:43.750
Get off the stage!

08:45.320 --> 08:46.150
Microphone.

08:47.390 --> 08:48.120
Microphone.

08:48.720 --> 08:49.670
Give it to me.

08:58.910 --> 09:01.200
Alright, just go.

09:19.910 --> 09:21.320
Honestly, your dad is really something.

09:21.320 --> 09:22.390
He's way out of line!

09:22.390 --> 09:23.670
It's bad enough
that he usually doesn't care about you.

09:23.670 --> 09:25.550
Now he's deciding everything for you!

09:25.550 --> 09:27.320
What's wrong with asking him to come back?

09:27.320 --> 09:28.440
He got to have you without any pain,

09:28.440 --> 09:29.320
and raise you without any effort.

09:29.320 --> 09:30.390
That's just not right!

09:30.390 --> 09:31.670
How can he get such a free ride?

09:31.670 --> 09:32.730
Don't you think so?

09:34.600 --> 09:35.200
All right.

09:35.270 --> 09:37.330
Stay out of my business. Just go home.

09:37.790 --> 09:40.030
You're always meddling in my business.

09:40.030 --> 09:42.160
Now I can't have a say in your business?

09:44.080 --> 09:45.150
You didn't come to school today.

09:45.150 --> 09:46.880
I was worried about you all day.

09:51.320 --> 09:52.670
What's there to worry about?

09:52.670 --> 09:53.960
I just overslept.

09:58.910 --> 10:00.200
About your major,

10:00.670 --> 10:01.800
what's in your mind?

10:05.200 --> 10:06.030
Tell me.

10:06.200 --> 10:08.600
If someone really important to you

10:08.600 --> 10:10.530
has all these expectations of you,

10:10.910 --> 10:12.790
then you have to live up
to their expectations

10:12.790 --> 10:14.320
until you leave this world.

10:15.270 --> 10:17.150
Is a life like that even meaningful?

10:17.150 --> 10:18.790
How is it not meaningful?

10:18.910 --> 10:20.570
Living itself is meaningful.

10:20.910 --> 10:23.440
Your existence is meaningful to me.

10:23.790 --> 10:26.150
You are the grand prize in my life.

10:27.080 --> 10:29.200
I promise I won't leave you.

10:30.320 --> 10:32.050
You are really important to me.

10:33.440 --> 10:34.320
What do you mean?

10:34.320 --> 10:35.320
You're my family.

10:38.550 --> 10:39.390
Family.

10:41.790 --> 10:42.790
Family.

10:46.030 --> 10:47.840
Talk to your dad properly.

10:47.960 --> 10:48.840
Same for me.

10:49.510 --> 10:52.080
We both need to work hard
for what we want.

10:52.440 --> 10:53.910
That's what you told me.

10:55.840 --> 10:57.370
Are you getting emotional?

10:59.200 --> 11:00.030
Yeah,

11:00.550 --> 11:01.320
I am.

11:01.840 --> 11:03.390
Why are you so good to me?

11:04.670 --> 11:06.530
Do I need a reason to be good to you?

11:06.790 --> 11:09.600
Aren't you super good to me too?

11:16.080 --> 11:16.840
Yi Lan.

11:17.270 --> 11:18.080
Hmm?

11:21.960 --> 11:22.840
What's up?

11:24.670 --> 11:25.200
About what you just said,

11:25.200 --> 11:26.330
promise you mean it.

11:26.790 --> 11:28.320
Of course I mean it.

11:28.790 --> 11:30.550
Pinky promise,

11:30.670 --> 11:31.720
no take backs.

11:34.600 --> 11:36.840
Didn't Chen Fan say
you have a performance tonight?

11:36.840 --> 11:37.700
What time is it?

11:42.490 --> 11:43.970
[HAVE FUN MUSIC]

11:42.550 --> 11:43.390
Chen Fan!

11:43.970 --> 11:45.670
[When the sun goes down,
it's time to drink]

11:44.790 --> 11:45.790
What took you so long?

11:45.790 --> 11:46.840
What happened?

11:48.390 --> 11:49.320
I left home late.

11:50.080 --> 11:50.740
Let's go in.

11:51.200 --> 11:51.720
Go in?

11:51.720 --> 11:52.510
What's the point now?

11:52.510 --> 11:54.390
Didn't you tell me you'd be on time?

11:54.390 --> 11:55.790
The boss already kicked me out!

11:55.790 --> 11:57.390
Our show is canceled!

11:58.630 --> 11:59.560
It's no big deal.

11:59.670 --> 12:00.870
We can do it next time.

12:00.910 --> 12:01.510
Let's go.

12:01.840 --> 12:02.390
Come on.

12:02.670 --> 12:04.200
What kind of attitude is that?

12:04.200 --> 12:05.870
Why are you talking
like you couldn't care less?

12:05.870 --> 12:08.200
If I knew you didn't care,
I would've replaced you ages ago.

12:08.200 --> 12:09.120
Chen Fan!

12:09.910 --> 12:12.310
You know damn well
why we started this band!

12:12.510 --> 12:14.200
We're in senior year now.

12:14.440 --> 12:15.840
If you weren't my friend,

12:15.870 --> 12:18.130
I wouldn't waste my time on this with you!

12:21.320 --> 12:22.200
Get lost!

12:22.290 --> 12:24.390
[When the sun goes down,
it's time to drink]

12:36.320 --> 12:37.270
Dad, I'm back.

12:37.550 --> 12:38.280
You're back.

12:39.550 --> 12:41.410
Wash your hands. Dinner's ready.

12:42.320 --> 12:42.720
Dad,

12:45.550 --> 12:48.680
I want to apply for the cello major
at Hailan University.

12:51.020 --> 12:53.230
[Senior Year Cello Practice Schedule]

12:51.320 --> 12:52.320
In five months,

12:52.440 --> 12:54.910
art students will take the joint exams
and the school-specific exams.

12:54.910 --> 12:57.080
Even if I fail, I can still take
the college entrance exam.

12:57.080 --> 12:58.910
I've made up my mind this time.

12:59.670 --> 13:00.440
Dad,

13:00.670 --> 13:03.080
I will do my best to achieve it.

13:05.150 --> 13:05.670
Lan.

13:07.030 --> 13:08.080
Some things

13:08.510 --> 13:10.790
can't be achieved just by working hard.

13:17.150 --> 13:18.390
If you just treat the cello

13:18.390 --> 13:19.750
as your hobby,

13:20.080 --> 13:21.480
I will fully support you.

13:21.790 --> 13:23.510
But if you want to make it your major,

13:23.510 --> 13:24.320
I don't agree.

13:24.600 --> 13:25.320
Besides,

13:25.910 --> 13:28.080
the cello is not a career path for you.

13:28.320 --> 13:29.150
Why?

13:30.080 --> 13:32.270
People can make a career out of cello too.

13:32.270 --> 13:33.070
I don't agree.

13:33.530 --> 13:34.560
[Senior Year Cello Practice Schedule]

13:47.600 --> 13:48.200
Dad.

14:02.370 --> 14:04.580
[Tong Xiaole's First Choice:
Hailan University, Finance]

14:22.940 --> 14:24.620
[Class 9, Grade 12]

14:42.270 --> 14:43.390
Are you crazy?

14:43.390 --> 14:44.600
Are you looking for trouble?

14:44.600 --> 14:46.440
You can't catch it and you blame me?

14:46.440 --> 14:47.200
Sorry, then.

14:54.440 --> 14:55.900
What's wrong with you two?

14:56.150 --> 14:56.910
Nothing.

14:57.440 --> 14:59.700
You're such a clam, not saying anything.

15:36.510 --> 15:38.270
Why are they on bad terms?

15:38.960 --> 15:40.320
I totally get what men are thinking.

15:40.320 --> 15:41.080
Ask me.

15:41.080 --> 15:43.410
Then analyze it from a man's perspective.

15:46.200 --> 15:48.910
Maybe they fell out
over a misunderstanding

15:49.270 --> 15:50.200
or a conflict.

16:01.790 --> 16:02.600
Or maybe

16:03.550 --> 16:06.910
they got into a fierce competition

16:07.550 --> 16:10.150
over some important resource
or opportunity.

16:10.790 --> 16:12.200
There is another possibility.

16:12.200 --> 16:13.440
One of them

16:13.840 --> 16:17.390
developed some kind of special feelings
for the other,

16:19.720 --> 16:21.790
but couldn't express them openly.

16:46.440 --> 16:47.910
So in this situation,

16:48.670 --> 16:49.790
what should be done?

16:49.790 --> 16:50.440
As men,

16:50.440 --> 16:52.370
they just need a fight to settle it.

16:52.550 --> 16:54.080
-A fight?
-A fight.

16:55.080 --> 16:57.080
Zhao Zhenghao is good-looking,

16:57.270 --> 16:59.790
but what goes on in his head
is really weird.

17:03.320 --> 17:04.069
I've got it.

17:18.960 --> 17:20.160
I'm so bored.

17:20.310 --> 17:21.960
How about we play a game?

17:22.400 --> 17:23.859
The loser will get flicked

17:24.109 --> 17:25.270
with two fingers.

17:25.270 --> 17:26.109
I'm in! I'm in!

17:26.829 --> 17:27.880
Ning, are you in?

17:29.110 --> 17:30.040
Come on, join us!

17:31.960 --> 17:32.920
Interesting.

17:35.110 --> 17:35.960
Me too.

17:37.790 --> 17:39.160
Xiaole, join us!

17:39.550 --> 17:40.310
Childish.

17:41.720 --> 17:42.400
Ignore him.

17:42.550 --> 17:43.550
Let's start.

17:44.030 --> 17:45.830
Rock, paper, scissors!

17:47.510 --> 17:48.350
Chen Fan wins.

17:49.550 --> 17:50.350
Go easy, okay?

17:53.480 --> 17:54.070
I...

17:54.110 --> 17:55.570
I'll take the punishment.

17:57.160 --> 17:58.000
Wait!

18:00.550 --> 18:01.680
I'll take it for her.

18:26.310 --> 18:27.070
Keep going.

18:27.480 --> 18:28.480
Don't be a coward.

18:34.070 --> 18:35.270
Xiaole wins.

18:52.400 --> 18:53.070
Alright, alright.

18:53.070 --> 18:54.800
You two stop. It's our turn now.

18:59.510 --> 19:00.550
Xiaole wins.

19:01.350 --> 19:02.480
Xiaole wins.

19:03.310 --> 19:04.960
Still Xiaole wins.

19:10.790 --> 19:12.880
It's our turn. You two stop.

19:13.240 --> 19:14.030
Keep going.

19:20.240 --> 19:21.070
Chen Fan wins.

19:28.790 --> 19:29.350
Class is starting.

19:29.350 --> 19:30.350
Stop, stop!

19:33.110 --> 19:34.070
Mr. Bu is here.

19:34.240 --> 19:35.000
What are you doing?

19:35.000 --> 19:36.000
Sit down!

19:40.070 --> 19:40.870
Class begins!

19:42.310 --> 19:43.640
It's getting worse.

20:09.940 --> 20:13.120
[Give you my love, from Tong Xiaole]

20:38.790 --> 20:40.720
Tong Xiaole,
is there something wrong with you?

20:40.720 --> 20:43.180
You actually bought me
an expired sandwich!

20:44.550 --> 20:45.350
Are you crazy?

20:46.030 --> 20:47.270
It's expired?

20:47.750 --> 20:50.100
Maybe it went bad
because of the hot weather.

20:50.100 --> 20:53.270
[Give you my love, from Chen Fan]

20:56.980 --> 21:01.300
[Give you my love, from Chen Fan]

21:37.240 --> 21:38.240
Men...

21:38.310 --> 21:39.830
So complicated.

22:00.310 --> 22:02.570
You don't seem
to be in a good mood lately.

22:03.790 --> 22:04.590
What's wrong?

22:06.270 --> 22:07.270
Nothing.

22:07.510 --> 22:08.790
I was just...

22:10.720 --> 22:13.400
thinking about the next performance.

22:18.480 --> 22:19.310
Good luck.

22:56.790 --> 22:57.720
Chen Fan,

22:58.000 --> 23:00.160
did you offend Tong Xiaole somehow?

23:01.310 --> 23:02.110
No.

23:03.270 --> 23:04.880
Don't let your little problems

23:04.880 --> 23:06.480
ruin the harmony of our group.

23:06.480 --> 23:08.740
Sort out whatever conflict you two have.

23:09.310 --> 23:11.030
Why is it my problem again?

23:11.310 --> 23:12.750
He's the one with tons of problems,

23:12.750 --> 23:13.810
and he's not loyal.

23:14.000 --> 23:14.880
I'm the unlucky one

23:14.880 --> 23:16.680
to have him as a friend, alright?

23:38.070 --> 23:39.600
It must be Chen Fan's fault.

23:41.790 --> 23:43.110
He has already explained himself.

23:43.110 --> 23:44.570
Why don't you believe him?

25:03.070 --> 25:04.310
It hurts.

25:06.070 --> 25:06.930
I didn't expect

25:07.550 --> 25:09.110
you would actually hit me.

25:10.000 --> 25:10.790
I'm...

25:11.720 --> 25:12.590
I'm sorry.

25:27.480 --> 25:29.480
I'll be fine after sitting for a bit.

25:34.200 --> 25:35.310
Tell me.

25:36.110 --> 25:37.440
What is it really about?

25:40.510 --> 25:41.640
You have no loyalty.

25:42.000 --> 25:43.070
You showed up late,

25:43.350 --> 25:44.750
and you looked down on me.

25:45.510 --> 25:47.030
You even hit me.

25:47.510 --> 25:49.550
If I knew you didn't care,
I would've replaced you ages ago.

25:49.550 --> 25:50.590
Chen Fan!

25:52.000 --> 25:54.240
What I did the other day counts
as hitting you?

25:54.240 --> 25:55.480
You just hit me too!

25:55.550 --> 25:56.210
We're even.

25:59.960 --> 26:00.720
You're so angry.

26:00.720 --> 26:03.120
Isn't it just
because of that performance?

26:04.550 --> 26:07.480
What do you mean
"just because of that performance"?

26:07.880 --> 26:09.000
That performance meant

26:09.000 --> 26:10.550
everything to me.

26:11.070 --> 26:11.790
For once,

26:11.790 --> 26:13.030
I finally felt like I was actually useful,

26:13.030 --> 26:14.490
but you didn't care at all!

26:15.880 --> 26:16.830
Chen Fan!

26:17.960 --> 26:19.480
You are very useful!

26:20.270 --> 26:21.200
Useful for what?

26:23.070 --> 26:23.880
You...

26:26.160 --> 26:26.960
You...

26:29.070 --> 26:30.030
You...

26:31.550 --> 26:32.830
Your family's villa is very useful.

26:32.830 --> 26:34.550
You know I care about you!

26:35.880 --> 26:37.740
Then why were you late on purpose?

26:42.350 --> 26:44.150
I had a fight with my dad that day.

26:48.400 --> 26:50.790
Why didn't you tell me
something so important?

26:50.790 --> 26:51.850
I also care a lot...

26:53.070 --> 26:53.600
about...

26:54.830 --> 26:55.560
your issues.

27:01.960 --> 27:03.400
I care about you too!

27:03.960 --> 27:04.640
Chen Fan!

27:06.400 --> 27:07.310
Xiaole!

27:14.400 --> 27:17.110
Tong Xiaole, you didn't even wait
for me today!

27:17.310 --> 27:18.710
Good morning, everyone.

27:20.110 --> 27:21.240
You two are good now?

27:21.750 --> 27:22.480
What are you talking about?

27:22.480 --> 27:23.790
When did we ever fall out?

27:23.790 --> 27:24.550
Never.

27:24.790 --> 27:25.550
Let's go.

27:31.350 --> 27:32.240
Men...

27:32.750 --> 27:33.720
So complicated.

27:51.070 --> 27:51.720
Shan.

27:52.350 --> 27:53.000
What's up?

27:53.000 --> 27:54.200
You seem distracted.

27:55.160 --> 27:56.070
Nothing.

27:59.200 --> 28:00.510
I've got a teacher for you.

28:00.510 --> 28:02.310
When will you start practicing?

28:04.790 --> 28:06.680
I haven't convinced my dad yet.

28:06.960 --> 28:08.110
He still doesn't agree.

28:08.110 --> 28:09.310
Still doesn't agree?

28:11.590 --> 28:13.110
Your dad is just...

28:18.790 --> 28:19.640
How about...

28:21.400 --> 28:22.350
I go talk to him?

28:22.550 --> 28:23.240
You'll go?

28:26.510 --> 28:27.510
Sure.

28:28.920 --> 28:29.850
When will you go?

28:31.590 --> 28:33.480
Today, I...

28:33.640 --> 28:34.200
Tonight!

28:35.310 --> 28:36.030
Tonight?

28:37.070 --> 28:38.880
I've made up my mind.

28:39.550 --> 28:40.880
Don't bring it up again.

28:42.000 --> 28:42.640
Please, allow me.

28:42.640 --> 28:43.000
Let me do it.

28:43.000 --> 28:43.400
Mr. Yi.

28:48.440 --> 28:49.030
Yi Lan

28:49.640 --> 28:51.070
has been going to your place a lot lately.

28:51.070 --> 28:52.070
Sorry for the trouble.

28:52.070 --> 28:53.070
No trouble at all.

28:53.590 --> 28:55.650
I like hearing Lan play the cello too.

28:56.270 --> 28:58.130
It always reminds me of my mentor.

29:08.000 --> 29:09.030
Your mentor...

29:10.270 --> 29:12.070
She put all her time and energy

29:12.960 --> 29:14.240
into the cello.

29:16.070 --> 29:19.750
She sacrificed everything
to pursue her dream.

29:38.440 --> 29:39.160
So,

29:40.880 --> 29:42.200
I don't want Lan

29:42.830 --> 29:44.230
to end up like her mother.

29:47.550 --> 29:48.550
Have some tea.

29:48.880 --> 29:49.740
Thanks, Mr. Yi.

29:52.720 --> 29:53.520
I understand.

29:55.030 --> 29:55.510
But...

29:56.310 --> 29:57.640
But don't you think...

29:59.960 --> 30:00.830
that now you're

30:02.310 --> 30:03.590
not so different

30:04.240 --> 30:05.840
from how my mentor used to be?

30:08.400 --> 30:09.400
When Yi Lan was little,

30:09.400 --> 30:11.640
my mentor forced her
to practice the cello.

30:11.640 --> 30:12.510
Now she has grown up,

30:12.510 --> 30:14.750
and you won't let her practice the cello.

30:14.750 --> 30:16.550
She's like a fish in your tank.

30:17.070 --> 30:17.790
She eats

30:17.790 --> 30:18.510
whatever you feed her.

30:18.510 --> 30:20.310
Do you really think she's happy?

30:24.480 --> 30:25.070
Mr. Yi.

30:26.640 --> 30:28.700
Lately, Lan has been going to my place

30:29.160 --> 30:30.790
to practice the cello
every day after school.

30:30.790 --> 30:32.450
Come and see when you're free.

30:47.110 --> 30:47.720
Shan.

30:48.070 --> 30:48.880
How did it go?

30:50.160 --> 30:51.110
How did what go?

30:51.310 --> 30:52.240
Did he agree?

30:54.830 --> 30:56.550
Focus on your cello classes first.

30:56.550 --> 30:57.550
We'll talk about it later.

30:57.550 --> 30:57.920
Go in.

31:03.160 --> 31:04.550
Did he agree or not?

31:06.030 --> 31:07.360
We'll discuss it later.

31:12.480 --> 31:13.590
Lan, you're back.

31:14.000 --> 31:15.860
I made braised pork for you today.

31:16.750 --> 31:17.270
Dad.

31:19.270 --> 31:20.400
Why won't you agree?

31:21.310 --> 31:22.830
Let's talk after dinner,

31:23.030 --> 31:23.550
okay?

31:23.830 --> 31:25.480
All you ever do is cook for me.

31:26.000 --> 31:27.930
You're afraid I'll end up like Mom,

31:28.510 --> 31:29.170
aren't you?

31:31.550 --> 31:33.950
After Mom left,
you never even mention her.

31:34.000 --> 31:36.130
And now you won't let me play the cello.

31:36.960 --> 31:37.550
Is it because in your heart,

31:37.550 --> 31:39.480
you no longer have a place for my mom?

31:39.480 --> 31:40.550
What nonsense are you talking about?

31:40.550 --> 31:43.000
There was nothing wrong
with Mom chasing her dream!

31:43.000 --> 31:45.030
And there is nothing wrong
with me loving music.

31:45.030 --> 31:46.430
Whether you agree or not,

31:46.750 --> 31:48.280
I'm going to play the cello.

31:48.750 --> 31:49.960
I will prove it to you.

32:08.350 --> 32:09.880
It's about Yi Lan, isn't it?

32:10.830 --> 32:11.400
Yes.

32:13.550 --> 32:15.070
Lan's father is stubborn.

32:15.510 --> 32:17.640
It will take some time to persuade him.

32:18.510 --> 32:19.110
Oh, right.

32:19.550 --> 32:22.010
I haven't paid for Lan's lessons yet,
right?

32:22.070 --> 32:22.790
Don't worry about it.

32:22.790 --> 32:24.160
The teacher happens
to be a friend of mine.

32:24.160 --> 32:25.620
We can talk about it later.

32:25.790 --> 32:26.880
That won't do.

32:27.160 --> 32:29.690
How can I let her take lessons
without paying?

32:29.790 --> 32:31.790
Tell me how much it is,

32:31.790 --> 32:33.320
and I'll transfer it to you.

32:35.000 --> 32:35.860
How about this?

32:36.160 --> 32:37.750
I'll ask the teacher to contact you,

32:37.750 --> 32:39.680
and you two can settle it directly.

32:40.310 --> 32:41.170
That works too.

32:41.960 --> 32:42.960
I'm leaving now.

32:42.960 --> 32:44.000
Okay, rest early.

32:59.240 --> 32:59.790
Xiaole,

33:00.000 --> 33:02.200
call me back when you have a moment.

33:02.480 --> 33:04.550
We're out of town
dealing with something urgent.

33:04.550 --> 33:06.550
We'll stay here for a few extra days.

33:07.350 --> 33:07.960
About choosing your major,

33:07.960 --> 33:10.200
if there's really no major
you have your heart set on,

33:10.200 --> 33:12.060
consider your dad's suggestion.

33:12.720 --> 33:13.400
Got it.

33:35.310 --> 33:37.400
I hope Mr. Tong can love Xiaole more.

33:37.720 --> 33:40.200
I'd give Xiaole
half of my dad's love for me.

34:03.270 --> 34:04.110
Sweetie,

34:04.550 --> 34:06.310
could you take a break
from practicing today?

34:06.310 --> 34:07.640
You've been practicing for too long.

34:07.640 --> 34:09.040
Don't wear yourself out.

34:09.630 --> 34:11.480
I've made your favorite dish.

34:11.480 --> 34:12.340
I'm not eating!

34:12.480 --> 34:13.760
It's your favorite!

34:31.590 --> 34:33.920
How did you know
I hadn't eaten dinner yet?

34:45.550 --> 34:49.070
Red phoenix. Red phoenix.

34:49.070 --> 34:54.630
Pink phoenix. Pink...
Colorful phoenix. Pink phoenix.

34:54.760 --> 34:55.440
Mr. Yi,

34:55.550 --> 34:57.070
just got back
from dropping your son off at school?

34:57.070 --> 34:57.760
Come on,

34:58.190 --> 34:58.710
let's play a couple rounds.

34:58.710 --> 34:59.640
A couple rounds.

35:00.440 --> 35:01.670
Your daughter's

35:01.840 --> 35:02.760
voice...

35:03.150 --> 35:04.280
She sounds amazing.

35:05.000 --> 35:05.590
Come on.

35:06.480 --> 35:07.150
Of course.

35:07.710 --> 35:08.970
With a voice like that,

35:09.440 --> 35:12.110
she's gonna be on TV someday!

35:13.280 --> 35:14.360
TV?

35:14.630 --> 35:15.440
What's wrong with that?

35:15.440 --> 35:16.400
Impressive.

35:16.920 --> 35:18.230
I see your daughter playing

35:18.230 --> 35:20.030
the cello or whatever every day.

35:20.360 --> 35:22.510
Is she planning
to take the art exam too?

35:22.510 --> 35:24.510
That's a tough path to take.

35:25.000 --> 35:26.150
Don't worry.

35:26.360 --> 35:27.550
Back in the day, her mom

35:27.550 --> 35:30.000
was the top student in the cello major.

35:30.630 --> 35:32.000
If my daughter wants to take the art exam,

35:32.000 --> 35:33.880
it'll be a piece of cake!

35:34.550 --> 35:35.410
Let me tell you.

35:35.710 --> 35:36.880
Time is running out.

35:37.030 --> 35:37.960
For the art exam,

35:38.030 --> 35:40.280
everyone is already getting
private tutors.

35:40.280 --> 35:41.760
Your daughter still goes
to regular school every day.

35:41.760 --> 35:43.190
You think she can make it?

35:43.440 --> 35:44.400
Mr. Yi,

35:44.400 --> 35:45.670
it seems like

35:45.710 --> 35:46.840
you don't care

35:46.960 --> 35:48.550
about your daughter at all.

35:51.070 --> 35:51.760
Come on,

35:52.360 --> 35:53.220
another round.

35:54.710 --> 35:55.110
I need to take this call.

35:55.110 --> 35:55.970
Another round.

35:59.070 --> 36:00.070
Such a sore loser.

36:03.360 --> 36:04.070
Shan.

36:05.510 --> 36:08.040
Do you still remember
what my mom looked like?

36:09.480 --> 36:10.030
I do.

36:11.000 --> 36:11.710
Although

36:12.400 --> 36:13.800
my memory of her face

36:14.510 --> 36:16.400
is already blurry,

36:17.920 --> 36:19.000
I always feel

36:19.320 --> 36:20.840
that if she were still here,

36:20.840 --> 36:22.230
she would definitely support me

36:22.230 --> 36:23.760
in doing what I want to do.

36:24.070 --> 36:24.800
Your dad

36:25.190 --> 36:27.990
really shouldn't stop you
from playing the cello.

36:28.150 --> 36:29.000
He probably

36:29.630 --> 36:31.280
hasn't made peace with himself yet.

36:31.280 --> 36:32.940
You need to give him some time.

36:33.840 --> 36:35.360
But you're the one

36:37.190 --> 36:38.630
who decides your own life.

36:38.630 --> 36:41.090
It has nothing to do
with your mom or your dad.

36:41.190 --> 36:43.790
So you really need
to think about it carefully.

37:17.070 --> 37:18.230
Xiaole!

37:25.070 --> 37:26.400
Xiaole!

37:27.360 --> 37:30.110
My dad agreed to let me take the art exam!

37:31.540 --> 37:34.210
♪ She left in spring ♪

37:34.850 --> 37:38.170
♪ All was like a dream ♪

37:38.520 --> 37:41.210
♪ Youth never lasts ♪

37:42.060 --> 37:45.510
♪ Just let her go ♪

37:45.700 --> 37:48.160
♪ The paper plane that was once set free ♪

37:48.340 --> 37:49.530
♪ Will find its way back
to the old desk and chair at school ♪
